Version 4.1
SHEET 1 2108 760
TEXT -1520 -820 Left 3 ;Osiris PDB Rev A  -  LTC4368-1 protection path
TEXT -1520 -770 Left 2 ;Refdes match the KiCad schematic:
TEXT -1520 -735 Left 2 ;   R1/R2/R3 = UV/OV divider    R4 = RGATE    R5 = shunt
TEXT -1520 -700 Left 2 ;   R6/R7 = SHDN divider        C1 = CGATE    C3 = CRETRY
TEXT -1520 -650 Left 2 ;CO 131u = Osiris 120u + PDB C4 10u + C2 1u   (NOMINAL - not DC-bias derated)
TEXT -1520 -615 Left 2 ;RLOAD 7.4R = 2A at 14.8V  PROVISIONAL.  NOTE: ADI's stock model had Roff=5 (ohms!),
TEXT -1520 -580 Left 2 ;  a hidden 2.9A load. Changed to Roff=1Meg so RLOAD is the ONLY load.
TEXT -1520 -562 Left 2 ;M1/M2 are SiR870ADP stand-ins - inrush is gate-controlled, not RDS(on)-limited
TEXT -1520 -545 Left 2 ;RFLT 100K is SIM-ONLY - your board has NO pull-up on PDB_FAULT_N
TEXT -1520 -495 Left 2 ;V1:  reverse -16.8V  ->  turn-on step at 300ms  ->  OV 19.5V at 1.1s  ->  UV 9V at 1.9s
TEXT -1520 -460 Left 2 ;S1:  hard-shorts the output at 2.5s (Ron=1) to exercise the breaker + RETRY
TEXT -1520 600 Left 2 !.tran 0 3 0 20u
TEXT -1520 640 Left 2 !.model Sload SW(Ron=1 Roff=1Meg Vt=.5 Vh=-.2)
TEXT -1520 690 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Ipk_inrush MAX I(R5) FROM 0.30 TO 0.45
TEXT -1520 730 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Vsh_pk MAX V(PROT)-V(OUT) FROM 0.30 TO 0.45
TEXT -1520 770 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Vout_ss AVG V(OUT) FROM 0.80 TO 0.95
